<section class="section-pad color-scheme-1">
  <div class="page-width page-width--narrow">
    <div class="section-head-center">
      <p class="text-subheading">SUPPORT</p>
      <h1 class="h1">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="pdp-accordions">
      <details class="pdp-acc" open>
        <summary class="h4">How long do MARQ Eau de Parfums &amp; Attars last on skin? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="pdp-acc__body">
          <p>Composed at high fine-fragrance oil concentrations, MARQ Eau de Parfums deliver 8 to 12+ hours of crisp projection on pulse points, while our alcohol-free Rubbing Roller Attars linger 14+ hours on skin and attire.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="pdp-acc">
        <summary class="h4">How should I store my MARQ perfume bottle? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="pdp-acc__body">
          <p>Our fluted sapphire glass naturally shields delicate citrus and botanical oils from UV light. Store upright in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and steam.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="pdp-acc">
        <summary class="h4">Are MARQ Perfumes vegan and phthalate-free? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="pdp-acc__body">
          <p>Yes—every MARQ fragrance is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, IFRA-certified, and formulated without phthalates, parabens, or artificial colorants.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="pdp-acc">
        <summary class="h4">What is your shipping &amp; return policy? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="pdp-acc__body">
          <p>Orders above ₹999 ship complimentary across India, and every full-size flacon is securely packaged with tracked express delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

